## Required OAuth Scopes (all 8)

`ai-studio`, `analytics`, `assistants`, `conversations`, `notifications`, `routing:readonly`, `speech-and-text-analytics:readonly`, `users:readonly`

Names match the Genesys scope picker exactly. Three are `:readonly` because this server only reads from the Routing, STA, and Users APIs — write access is neither needed nor requested.

Run `smoke_test_auth()` after login to verify.
